.TH KTX_HELP 1 "2026-10-27" "ktx (Rust port)" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ktx_help \- show the manual page of a ktx command
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ktx
help [<command>]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the manual page of the given command, or of
.B ktx
itself when no command is given. Pages next to the executable
.RI ( ../share/man/man1 )
are preferred.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
ktx help create
.fi
.SH NOTES
This is an unofficial Rust port of Khronos KTX\-Software (libktx and the ktx CLI); it is not
the Khronos build of the tool. The complete, current option list is printed by
.B ktx help \-\-help.
.SH SEE ALSO
ktx(1)
